{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wonder what it\u2019d be like to get isekai\u2019d with your unserious cousin and have to create new identities to survive in a world of magical and terrifying creatures? Follow the two cousins, Kam and Simon, as they laugh, cry, and stumble through a world they\u2019ve only imagined could be real in games and on TV.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tales of SclObonia is a turn-based fantasy RPG featuring dungeons, puzzles, and choice-based questlines. Level grind to your heart\u2019s content to upgrade skills, discover new techniques, and uncover the mysteries of a foreign land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Squabble up as Simon, a brawler from the Woods of Ingle, as you swing first and ask questions never.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze the world around you as Kam, as you learn to manipulate the arcane arts of SclObonia and take down your enemies (wits and a wand optional)!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3004510?t=1742743290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004510/78859184ea748b3c876fd1acdf0e9b4926287db4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742743290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004510/5e2483770a69bf69e35b4c9a78eebb312f6eb8e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742743290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004510/5e2483770a69bf69e35b4c9a78eebb312f6eb8e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742743290","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wonder what it\u2019d be like to get isekai\u2019d with your unserious cousin and have to create new identities to survive in a world of magical and terrifying creatures? Follow the two cousins, Kam and Simon, as they laugh, cry, and stumble through a world they\u2019ve only imagined could be real in games and on TV.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tales of SclObonia is a turn-based fantasy RPG featuring dungeons, puzzles, and choice-based questlines. Level grind to your heart\u2019s content to upgrade skills, discover new techniques, and uncover the mysteries of a foreign land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Squabble up as Simon, a brawler from the Woods of Ingle, as you swing first and ask questions never.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze the world around you as Kam, as you learn to manipulate the arcane arts of SclObonia and take down your enemies (wits and a wand optional)!</p>","developers":["SclObo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3004510/3772cd41014b71a60c188aaee49c4fb5a7fcb1e7/header.jpg?t=1742743290","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13 (or better)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 (or better) or Apple M1 (or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible OpenGL / VRAM 1GB (or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108885,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108885/movie480.mp4?t=1742743288","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108885/movie_max.mp4?t=1742743288"},"name":"Tales of SclObonia","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108885/0f697b29234da0588d431777578706cf114e9d28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742743288","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamsta